<title>HONG KONG: China Travel Service HK mandates US$150 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>China Travel Service HK mandates US$150 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Travel Service (Holdings) Hong Kong Ltd has mandated LTCB Asia and Sanwa International Finance to arrange a US$150 million floating rate note issue, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of five years with no put or call options. The issue will be priced at par.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
<p>China Travel Service (Holdings) is the parent of China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
